Am trying to develop a script that will update existing vaulted account fields based on a provided CSV
I need the script to do validation of Platform type before updating as there are different platforms
Safe updates will mean to move an account from one safe to another
The script should have comments on line of action
Script to follow a structure where env variable file are reference seperately
For Authentication, i want it to prompt the identity service credentials then hash the auth token, and use the auth token to login 
Ensure this does not look like AI generated code
Also this should have a readme.md file with Description,Dependencies
While updating, if there are platform or safe changes, script should check to make sure platform device type match, also safe update would mean moving account to new safe
Make this script intuitive as much as possible, avoid making it look like AI generated script


